from which we eliminate answer choices $\textbf{(D)}$ and $\textbf{(E)}.$
Note that
\begin{alignat*}{8} |f(800)-f(300)| &\leq \frac12|800-300| &&= 250, \\ |f(800)-f(900)| &\leq \frac12|800-900| &&= 50, \\ |f(400)-f(300)| &\leq \frac12|400-300| &&= 50, \\ |f(400)-f(900)| &\leq \frac12|400-900| &&= 250. \\ \end{alignat*}
